  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevents domestic violence of 200 women in Ecuador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The cycle of violence in which many women grow up prevents them from living fully, normalizes harmful behaviors and subjects them to constant insecurity. Its impact is immediate and far-reaching, including multiple physical, sexual, psychological, and even lethal consequences; it negatively affects women&apos;s well-being and prevents their full participation in society.</narrative>
  </description>
